Z||000000||stimpy||04-27-2000||07:59 PM||||I want to take this opportunity to apologize to one and all for taking the (very) low road this morning with a post I added on to an old thread that had been referenced in another thread. If you don't know what I am talking about, please don't go hunting for it, it will only bring you down too.<BR>For those who are aware of the situation, I do not think there would be anyone who would condone my words, even those who may agree with my ideas. This was a low for me and I do not feel good about it.<BR>I start this thread to act as a public pillory. If any member feels strongly about the situation, feel free to put your licks in, I deserve it.  I will not try to defend myself, as it was indefensible.  <BR>||||reg||9
